    "section_text": "History Minor Curriculum The history/political science department offers a minor in history. To qualify, all students must take 15 hours of course work in history to include: HISTORY 1100 Early Western Civilization 3 or HISTORY 1200 Modern Western Civilization HISTORY 1300 American History To 1877 3 or HISTORY 1310 American History Since 1877 An additional 9 hours of an approved sequence of 2000 or higher level courses. 9",
    "section_html": "<div class=\"tab_content\" id=\"minorstextcontainer\">\n<a name=\"minorstext\"></a><h2>History Minor Curriculum</h2> <p>The history/political science department offers a minor in history. To qualify, all students must take 15 hours of course work in history to include:</p> <table class=\"sc_courselist\" width=\"100%\"><colgroup><col class=\"codecol\"/><col class=\"titlecol\"/><col align=\"char\" char=\".\" class=\"hourscol\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr class=\"even firstrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=HISTORY%201100\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'HISTORY 1100');\" title=\"HISTORY 1100\">HISTORY 1100</a></td><td>Early Western Civilization</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"orclass even firstrow\"><td class=\"codecol orclass\">or <a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=HISTORY%201200\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'HISTORY 1200');\" title=\"HISTORY 1200\">HISTORY 1200</a></td><td colspan=\"2\"> Modern Western Civilization</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=HISTORY%201300\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'HISTORY 1300');\" title=\"HISTORY 1300\">HISTORY 1300</a></td><td>American History To 1877</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"orclass odd\"><td class=\"codecol orclass\">or <a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=HISTORY%201310\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'HISTORY 1310');\" title=\"HISTORY 1310\">HISTORY 1310</a></td><td colspan=\"2\"> American History Since 1877</td></tr> <tr class=\"even lastrow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">An additional 9 hours of an approved sequence of 2000 or higher level courses.</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\">9</td></tr> </tbody></table>\n</div>"
